<title>Bolas em nonágono rotativo</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: #0a0e16; }
  #cv { display: block; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; }
